   "proposal": "I\u2019m excited to build your Pinecone\u2011based similarity search with a typed REST API. My recent work on the \"Semantic product search\" project (ai_ml:readme:shop-semsearch#s1) involved managing a vector database for high\u2011throughput similarity queries, and I shipped a Pinecone integration that lifted conversion rates (ai_ml:proposal:prop-ai-148#s0). I have strong Python engineering experience demonstrated across multiple repos (ai_ml:readme:match-maker#s1, ai_ml:readme:safe-prompt#s1, ai_ml:case:ai-11#s2). Serving models behind typed REST endpoints is a core part of my \"Lexi\u2011RAG\" and \"Match\u2011Maker\" services (ai_ml:readme:lexi-rag#s1, ai_ml:readme:match-maker#s1). For computer\u2011vision tasks I used OpenCV in production\u2011grade pipelines for crop disease classification and packaging defect detection (ai_ml:case:ai-14#s4, ai_ml:case:ai-05#s4). Finally, I have built systematic LLM evaluation frameworks (ai_ml:case:ai-16#s4, ai_ml:readme:paper-pal#s1). I can start immediately at $45/hr, ensuring the project exceeds your $300 minimum."
